771-25/499308522_1545297666955517_6438462819138269756_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LUZK5TCGJc8Q7kNvwHCiOwR&_nc_oc=Adqg-4UNzh20b5ynvVsd1ClyBwxUazZ84lMNkr96r0cOLBerYjCqQBX7a10Ds_J_KDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUj4ziobo7Hd_KOh1xOBksfRvgMG_fa7tJf3UziN0LnHA&oe=6B104A3C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Keko", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Keko is a multiplayer VR horror experience that weaponizes nostalgia and realism to keep you on edge. Trapped in a glitched reality with your squad, you must navigate an environment that seamlessly twists between gritty, low-poly PS1-era aesthetics and terrifyingly crisp, high-quality modern graphics.\n\nIn VR, the terror is up close and personal. Team up, watch each other's backs, and try to survive as the world alters around you. What looks like a harmless pixelated shadow in retro-mode might become a living nightmare when the graphics shift.\n{1693648391852156}", "short_description": "Keko is a multiplayer VR horror experience that weaponizes nostalgia and realism to keep you on edge. Trapped in a glitched reality with your squad, you must navigate an environment that seamlessly twists between gritty, low-poly PS1-era aesthetics and terrifyingly crisp, high-quality modern graphics.\n\nIn VR, the terror is up close and personal. Team up, watch each other's backs, and try to survive as the world alters around you. What looks like a harmless pixelated shadow in retro-mode might be"}]}, "developer_name": "Northern Attom Development", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/kekovr/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "pinkofr", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/kekovr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_categ